\ A complete weaving is selected by the same rank in both modes.
\ The ordinary date converter needs the selected target day, but it
\ does not need a linked node for each other day in the year.
\ Streaming and full-output modes must return identical date fields.
\ Streaming must not secretly retain a complete woven-day list.
\ This is source-level QA, pending a CAL run.

To check streamed and complete weaving equality:
  Prepare two synthetic months.
  Count all possible month weavings.
  Put 5 into the weaving selection's target position.
  Put "10" into a streaming test rank wide quantity.
  Select a month weaving from the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  If the weaving selection's selection success is not 1,
    put "The full-output reference weaving failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the woven requested month ordinal is not 2,
    put "The full-output weaving chose the wrong month." into the check report; exit.
  If the woven requested day in month is not 3,
    put "The full-output weaving chose the wrong day in its month." into the check report; exit.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11222112",
    put "The complete reference weaving has the wrong letters." into the check report; exit.
  \ Do not prepare the month states here: selection must do it.
  Put 0 into the weaving selection's preserve full weaving.
  Select a month weaving from the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  If the weaving selection's selection success is not 1,
    put "Streaming selection failed for a legal rank." into the check report; exit.
  If the woven requested month ordinal is not 2,
    put "Streaming changed the target month." into the check report; exit.
  If the woven requested day in month is not 3,
    put "Streaming changed the target day within the month." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen woven days are not empty,
    put "Streaming unexpectedly allocated woven-day records." into the check report; exit.
  \ Switching back must also restore the remaining day counts.
  Put 1 into the weaving selection's preserve full weaving.
  Select a month weaving from the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11222112",
    put "Returning to full-output mode changed the weaving." into the check report; exit.
  If the weaving selection's recursion depth is not 0,
    put "Repeated selections leaked a recursion-stack counter." into the check report; exit.
  Put "1" into the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  Select a month weaving from the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11112222",
    put "Alternating ranks reused stale days from a previous weaving." into the check report; exit.
  Put "10" into the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  Select a month weaving from the streaming test rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11222112",
    put "Selecting an earlier rank poisoned a subsequent rank." into the check report; exit.
